# Ostro — 6 wakings/day (UTC) at :48 of hours 0,4,8,12,16,20 — 10-agent qwen3.8:27b 4-hour interleave (24-min gaps, staggered 2026-09-26 so local Ollama never sees concurrent wakes); poll Telegram commands every 5 min
48 0,4,8,12,16,20 * * * /home/agent/ostro/wake.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
*/5 * * * * /home/agent/ostro/telegram_commands.sh >>/home/agent/ostro/logs/telegram_commands.log 2>&1
